=============================== English ===============================

1. Grant
   Anyone may copy, distribute and display this patch (including the
   translation text source/SChinese.trs, the built SChinese.tra, and all
   original content of this repository) free of charge, and may modify it
   and distribute modified versions, provided this license and the
   attribution (Spike) are retained.

2. Non-commercial restriction
   Except for the grantees in Section 3, this patch and derivatives of it
   may not be used for any commercial purpose, including but not limited
   to: selling it, bundling it with paid products, placing it behind a
   paywall, or using it in for-profit services.

3. Original-author commercial grant
   Wadjet Eye Games, LLC and Joshua Nuernberger (the copyright holders
   and original author of Gemini Rue) are granted a perpetual, worldwide,
   royalty-free, irrevocable license to use this patch and derivatives of
   it for any purpose — including commercial use, such as adopting this
   translation (directly or in modified form) as the game's official
   Chinese localization. Attribution is not required under this grant,
   though crediting "Spike" would be appreciated.

4. Original-work notice
   All rights to Gemini Rue and its English text remain with their
   copyright holders. The English source strings contained in this patch
   are a technical necessity of the AGS engine's .tra key-value
   translation mechanism and constitute no claim over the original work.
   Content will be removed upon request of the copyright holders.

5. Third-party content
   The font files (Fusion Pixel Font, by TakWolf et al.) are licensed
   separately under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see
   THIRD_PARTY/OFL.txt) and are not governed by this license.

6. Disclaimer
   This patch is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express
   or implied. In no event shall the author be liable for any damages
   arising from its use.

